<%# DNS has no answer for the server's hostname. %>
<p>
  There's no record of <code><%= host %></code> on the internet yet. Either it's
  misspelled in Settings → Deploy, or the domain doesn't point anywhere yet.
</p>

<ol>
  <li>Check the server address in Settings → Deploy.</li>
  <li>Confirm the address is found — this should print your server's IP address:</li>
</ol>
<pre>dig +short <%= host %></pre>

<p>A domain you've just set up can take a few hours to be found everywhere. Then deploy again.</p>

<p>
  More detail:
  <a href="/documentation/roe/troubleshoot-deployment#troubleshooting-kamal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Troubleshooting → Deployment</a>
</p>
